# Cunning Giant: "If CARDNAME is unblocked, you may have it assign its
# combat damage to a creature defending player controls." (Combat.java:
# 868-871, 901-905). Unblocked, its controller accepts and picks Grizzly
# Bears: all 4 damage goes to the Bears, none to the AI.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks none
declareblockers
advance
advance
queue confirmeffect true
queue cardchoice 2
combatdamage
advance
